ned}∇f(x) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{4}+{y}^{4}-4{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}+10) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{4}+{y}^{4}-4{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}+10)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}^{3}-8x \\\\ 4{y}^{3}-8y\\end{bmatrix},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand the Hessian is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}_{f}(x) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(4{x}^{3}-8x) & \\frac{∂}{∂x}(4{y}^{3}-8y) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(4{x}^{3}-8x) & \\frac{∂}{∂y}(4{y}^{3}-8y)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}12{x}^{2}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 12{y}^{2}-8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our Newton-Raphson formula is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-{\\begin{bmatrix}12{x}^{2}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 12{y}^{2}-8\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{n}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}^{3}-8x \\\\ 4{y}^{3}-8y\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nFor the second iteration, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & ={x}_{1}-{\\begin{bmatrix}12{x}^{2}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 12{y}^{2}-8\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{1}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}^{3}-8x \\\\ 4{y}^{3}-8y\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{1}} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-{\\begin{bmatrix}12(2)^{2}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 12(2)^{2}-8\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}4(2)^{3}-8(2) \\\\ 4(2)^{3}-8(2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-{\\begin{bmatrix}40 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 40\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 16\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{40\\cdot 40-0\\cdot 0}\\begin{bmatrix}40 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 40\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 16\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{1\\,600}\\begin{bmatrix}640 \\\\ 640\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1.6 \\\\ 1.6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5789f198-74e1-5b68-a9ba-3bb1808b8652" "answer-field-862f5751-3521-5986-9159-683bde1d18c7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5789f198-74e1-5b68-a9ba-3bb1808b8652" :answer-field/id #uuid "5789f198-74e1-5b68-a9ba