= \\\\ \\frac{3t(1+\\sqrt{1-t})}{(1-\\sqrt{1-t})(1+\\sqrt{1-t})} & = \\\\ \\frac{3t(1+\\sqrt{1-t})}{{1}^{2}-(\\sqrt{1-t})^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{3t(1+\\sqrt{1-t})}{1-(1-t)} & = \\\\ \\frac{3\\cancel{t}(1+\\sqrt{1-t})}{\\cancel{t}} & = \\\\ 3(1+\\sqrt{1-t}) & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-cc06a8d8-50aa-5640-bc51-88b6bf88a0d0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-cc06a8d8-50aa-5640-bc51-88b6bf88a0d0" :answer-field/id #uuid "cc06a8d8-50aa-5640-bc51-88b6bf88a0d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4f7f5fd8-4a4f-5258-bc4b-8b18611c412d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-053449de-1640-59ff-8add-5d09a15ab3b8" "answer-4f7f5fd8-4a4f-5258-bc4b-8b18611c412d" "answer-dad32430-bd0b-52bf-9c2e-17412e09f115" "answer-90e3da05-aacf-5f13-859e-cd646558384f" "answer-c4784f20-700b-5193-9d79-5c5d10119b44"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-053449de-1640-59ff-8add-5d09a15ab3b8" :answer/id #uuid "053449de-1640-59ff-8add-5d09a15ab3b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(1+\\sqrt{1-t})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4f7f5fd8-4a4f-5258-bc4b-8b18611c412d" :answer/id #uuid "4f7f5fd8-4a4f-5258-bc4b-8b18611c412d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3(1+\\sqrt{1-t})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dad32430-bd0b-52bf-9c2e-17412e09f115" :answer/id #uuid "dad32430-bd0b-52bf-9c2e-17412e09f115" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1-t}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-90e3da05-aacf-5f13-859e-cd646558384f" :answer/id #uuid "90e3da05-aacf-5f13-859e-cd646558384f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1-t}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4784f20-700b-5193-9d79-5c5d10119b44" :answer/id #uuid "c4784f20-700b-5193-9d79-5c5d10119b44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3t(1+\\sqrt{1-t})}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-57f8edcf-bb4c-5c62-90a9-46d6df888cba" :question/id #uuid "57f8edcf-bb4c-5c62-90a9-46d6df888cba" :question/math-academy-id "q-111087" :question/problem "Rationalize the denominator of $\\frac{4{r}^{2}}{\\sqrt{2r-1}-1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, note that the denominator's conjugate is $\\sqrt{2r-1}+1.$\n\nNow, to rationalize the denominator, we multiply both the numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt{2r-1}+1,$ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4{r}^{2}}{\\sqrt{2r-1}-1} & = \\\\ \\frac{4{r}^{2}}{\\sqrt{2r-1}-1}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2r-1}+1}{\\sqrt{2r-1}+1} & = \\\\ \\frac{4{r}^{2}(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)}{(\\sqrt{2r-1}-1)(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{4{r}^{2}(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)}{(\\sqrt{2r-1})^{2}-{1}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{4{r}^{2}(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)}{2r-1-1} & = \\\\ \\frac{4{r}^{2}(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)}{2r-2} & = \\\\ \\frac{2{r}^{2}(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)}{r-1} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-62a892d6-ff55-5220-9118-e2d113d46140"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-62a892d6-ff55-5220-9118-e2d113d46140" :answer-field/id #uuid "62a892d6-ff55-5220-9118-e2d113d46140" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0273e2de-cefa-57b0-ad98-a84b729c417a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0273e2de-cefa-57b0-ad98-a84b729c417a" "answer-e7997637-1b0c-51ea-8e35-3be1310d3e9d" "answer-84fb11aa-f083-582f-84d7-266a467070fa" "answer-e69b51c1-8417-56a6-934c-f1efd30054b9" "answer-5cc92496-09f1-5f1a-8946-cc0ca6917179"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0273e2de-cefa-57b0-ad98-a84b729c417a" :answer/id #uuid "0273e2de-cefa-57b0-ad98-a84b729c417a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2{r}^{2}(\\sqrt{2r-1}+1)}{r-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e7997637-1b0c-51ea-8e35-3be1310d3e9d" :answer/id #uuid "e7997637-1b0c-51ea-